603 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 1149 0 R
/T ([WHAT WE OBSERVED]: Retrieval worked well \(Recall@1: 98.4%\). After improving the RAG prompt to use Qwen's chat template properly, RAG+Qwen reached 98.02% accuracy , significantly better than our earlier attempt \(90.5%\), but still below fine-tuned Qwen \(99.05%\). Interestingly, RAG produced fewer invalid outputs \(55\) than fine-tuning alone \(241\).)
/E ([WHAT WE OBSERVED]: Retrieval worked well \(Recall@1: 98.4%\). After improving the RAG prompt to use Qwen's chat template properly, RAG+Qwen reached 98.02% accuracy , significantly better than our earlier attempt \(90.5%\), but still below fine-tuned Qwen \(99.05%\). Interestingly, RAG produced fewer invalid outputs \(55\) than fine-tuning alone \(241\).)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
