<<
/Title ([WHAT WE OBSERVED]: Retrieval worked well \(Recall@1: 98.4%\). After improving the RAG prompt to use Qwen's chat template properly, RAG+Qwen reached 98.02% accuracy , significantly better than our earlier attempt \(90.5%\), but still below fine-tuned Qwen \(99.05%\). Interestingly, RAG produced fewer invalid outputs \(55\) than fine-tuning alone \(241\).)
/Dest [22 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1423 0 R
/Prev 1519 0 R
/Next 1510 0 R
